cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. For the methods themselves,
  please also cite the book listed under references.
type: software
title: "finlab: financial machine learning in Python"
abstract: >-
  Python implementations of the methods in Marcos López de Prado's Advances in
  Financial Machine Learning, organised by chapter. Most methods are tested
  against a naive reference, and proof notes label each claim as proved, tested,
  measured or claimed from the book only.
authors:
  - alias: landtml
version: 0.1.5
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/landtml/finlab-ml"
url: "https://github.com/landtml/finlab-ml"
keywords:
  - financial machine learning
  - purged cross-validation
  - combinatorial purged cross-validation
  - triple-barrier labeling
  - fractional differentiation
  - deflated Sharpe ratio
  - probability of backtest overfitting
  - hierarchical risk parity
references:
  - type: book
    title: Advances in Financial Machine Learning
    authors:
      - family-names: López de Prado
        given-names: Marcos
    publisher:
      name: Wiley
    year: 2018
    isbn: 978-1-119-48208-6
